nd Jesus answered them,", "tokens": [50778, 400, 2705, 10103, 552, 11, 50867], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2218632662206664, "compression_ratio": 1.6179775280898876, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007791802636347711}, {"id": 47, "seek": 14634, "start": 157.12, "end": 158.34, "text": " Have faith in God.", "tokens": [50904, 3560, 4522, 294, 1265, 13, 50965], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2218632662206664, "compression_ratio": 1.6179775280898876, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007791802636347711}, {"id": 48, "seek": 14634, "start": 158.86, "end": 159.84, "text": " Truly I say to you,", "tokens": [50991, 43548, 286, 584, 281, 291, 11, 51040], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2218632662206664, "compression_ratio": 1.6179775280898876, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007791802636347711}, {"id": 49, "seek": 14634, "start": 159.92000000000002, "end": 161.28, "text": " whoever says to this mountain,", "tokens": [51044, 11387, 1619, 281, 341, 6937, 11, 51112], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2218632662206664, "compression_ratio": 1.6179775280898876, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007791802636347711}, {"id": 50, "seek": 14634, "start": 161.62, "end": 163.36, "text": " Be taken up and thrown into the sea,", "tokens": [51129, 879, 2726, 493, 293, 11732, 666, 264, 4158, 11, 51216], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2218632662206664, "compression_ratio": 1.6179775280898876, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007791802636347711}, {"id": 51, "seek": 14634, "start": 163.68, "end": 165.3, "text": " and does not doubt in his heart,", "tokens": [51232, 293, 775, 406, 6385, 294, 702, 1917, 11, 51313], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2218632662206664, "compression_ratio": 1.6179775280898876, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007791802636347711}, {"id": 52, "seek": 14634, "start": 165.46, "end": 168.04, "text": " but believes that what he says will come to pass,", "tokens": [51321, 457, 12307, 300, 437, 415, 1619, 486, 808, 281, 1320, 11, 51450], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2218632662206664, "compression_ratio": 1.6179775280898876, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007791802636347711}, {"id": 53, "seek": 14634, "start": 168.38, "end": 170.0, "text": " it will be done for him.", "tokens": [51467, 309, 486, 312, 1096, 337, 796, 13, 51548], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2218632662206664, "compression_ratio": 1.6179775280898876, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007791802636347711}, {"id": 54, "seek": 14634, "start": 171.06, "end": 172.28, "text": " Therefore I tell you,", "tokens": [51601, 7504, 286, 980, 291, 11, 51662], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2218632662206664, "compression_ratio": 1.6179775280898876, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007791802636347711}, {"id": 55, "seek": 14634, "start": 172.28, "end": 173.88, "text": " whatever you ask in prayer,", "tokens": [51662, 2035, 291, 1029, 294, 8767, 11, 51742], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2218632662206664, "compression_ratio": 1.6179775280898876, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007791802636347711}, {"id": 56, "seek": 14634, "start": 174.32, "end": 175.76, "text": " believe that you have received it,", "tokens": [51764, 1697, 300, 291, 362, 4613, 309, 11, 51836], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2218632662206664, "compression_ratio": 1.6179775280898876, "no_speech_prob": 0.0007791802636347711}, {"id": 57, "seek": 17576, "start": 175.76, "end": 177.26, "text": " and it will be yours.", "tokens": [50365, 293, 309, 486, 312, 6342, 13, 50440], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3048225276726336, "compression_ratio": 1.7661290322580645, "no_speech_prob": 0.002265360439196229}, {"id": 58, "seek": 17576, "start": 178.26, "end": 179.76, "text": " And whenever you stand praying,", "tokens": [50490, 400, 5699, 291, 1463, 15611, 11, 50565], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3048225276726336, "compression_ratio": 1.7661290322580645, "no_speech_prob": 0.002265360439196229}, {"id": 59, "seek": 17576, "start": 179.76, "end": 182.45999999999998, "text": " forgive, if you have anything against anyone,", "tokens": [50565, 10718, 11, 498, 291, 362, 1340, 1970, 2878, 11, 50700], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3048225276726336, "compression_ratio": 1.7661290322580645, "no_speech_prob": 0.002265360439196229}, {"id": 60, "seek": 17576, "start": 182.45999999999998, "end": 187.26, "text": " so that your Father also who is in heaven may forgive you your trespasses.", "tokens": [50700, 370, 300, 428, 7085, 611, 567, 307, 294, 7162, 815, 10718, 291, 428, 46347, 26615, 13, 50940], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3048225276726336, "compression_ratio": 1.7661290322580645, "no_speech_prob": 0.002265360439196229}, {"id": 61, "seek": 17576, "start": 189.26, "end": 191.26, "text": " And they came again to Jerusalem.", "tokens": [51040, 400, 436, 1361, 797, 281, 15393, 13, 51140], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3048225276726336, "compression_ratio": 1.7661290322580645, "no_speech_prob": 0.002265360439196229}, {"id": 62, "seek": 17576, "start": 191.26, "end": 193.26, "text": " And as he was walking in the temple,", "tokens": [51140, 400, 382, 415, 390, 4494, 294, 264, 10184, 11, 51240], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3048225276726336, "compression_ratio": 1.7661290322580645, "no_speech_prob": 0.002265360439196229}, {"id": 63, "seek": 17576, "start": 193.26, "end": 196.26, "text": " the chief priests and the scribes and the elders came to him.", "tokens": [51240, 264, 9588, 27192, 293, 264, 39435, 279, 293, 264, 22737, 1361, 281, 796, 13, 51390], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3048225276726336, "compression_ratio": 1.7661290322580645, "no_speech_prob": 0.002265360439196229}, {"id": 64, "seek": 17576, "start": 196.26, "end": 197.76, "text": " And they said to him,", "tokens": [51390, 400, 436, 848, 281, 796, 11, 51465], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3048225276726336, "compression_ratio": 1.7661290322580645, "no_speech_prob": 0.002265360439196229}, {"id": 65, "seek": 17576, "start": 197.76, "end": 200.26, "text": " By what authority are you doing these things,", "tokens": [51465, 3146, 437, 8281, 366, 291, 884, 613, 721, 11, 51590], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3048225276726336, "compression_ratio": 1.7661290322580645, "no_speech_prob": 0.002265360439196229}, {"id": 66, "seek": 17576, "start": 200.26, "end": 202.76, "text": " or who gave you this authority to do them?", "tokens": [51590, 420, 567, 2729, 291, 341, 8281, 281, 360, 552, 30, 51715], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3048225276726336, "compression_ratio": 1.7661290322580645, "no_speech_prob": 0.002265360439196229}, {"id": 67, "seek": 17576, "start": 202.76, "end": 204.76, "text": " Jesus said to them,", "tokens": [51715, 2705, 848, 281, 552, 11, 51815], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3048225276726336, "compression_ratio": 1.7661290322580645, "no_speech_prob": 0.002265360439196229}, {"id": 68, "seek": 20476, "start": 204.76, "end": 207.26, "text": " I will ask you one question.", "tokens": [50365, 286, 486, 1029, 291, 472, 1168, 13, 50490], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11772225952148438, "compression_ratio": 1.6459143968871595, "no_speech_prob": 0.006122464779764414}, {"id": 69, "seek": 20476, "start": 207.26, "end": 210.76, "text": " Answer me, and I will tell you by what authority I do these things.", "tokens": [50490, 24545, 385, 11, 293, 286, 486, 980, 291, 538, 437, 8281, 286, 360, 613, 721, 13, 50665], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11772225952148438, "compression_ratio": 1.6459143968871595, "no_speech_prob": 0.006122464779764414}, {"id": 70, "seek": 20476, "start": 211.26, "end": 214.76, "text": " Was the baptism of John from heaven or from man?", "tokens": [50690, 3027, 264, 34352, 295, 2619, 490, 7162, 420, 490, 587, 30, 50865], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11772225952148438, "compression_ratio": 1.6459143968871595, "no_speech_prob": 0.006122464779764414}, {"id": 71, "seek": 20476, "start": 215.26, "end": 216.26, "text": " Answer me.", "tokens": [50890, 24545, 385, 13, 50940], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11772225952148438, "compression_ratio": 1.6459143968871595, "no_speech_prob": 0.006122464779764414}, {"id": 72, "seek": 20476, "start": 216.76, "end": 219.26, "text": " And they discussed it with one another, saying,", "tokens": [50965, 400, 436, 7152, 309, 365, 472, 1071, 11, 1566, 11, 51090], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11772225952148438, "compression_ratio": 1.6459143968871595, "no_speech_prob": 0.006122464779764414}, {"id": 73, "seek": 20476, "start": 219.26, "end": 221.76, "text": " If we say from heaven, he will say,", "tokens": [51090, 759, 321, 584, 490, 7162, 11, 415, 486, 584, 11, 51215], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11772225952148438, "compression_ratio": 1.6459143968871595, "no_speech_prob": 0.006122464779764414}, {"id": 74, "seek": 20476, "start": 221.76, "end": 223.76, "text": " Why then did you not believe him?", "tokens": [51215, 1545, 550, 630, 291, 406, 1697, 796, 30, 51315], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11772225952148438, "compression_ratio": 1.6459143968871595, "no_speech_prob": 0.006122464779764414}, {"id": 75, "seek": 20476, "start": 223.76, "end": 226.26, "text": " But shall we say from man?", "tokens": [51315, 583, 4393, 321, 584, 490, 587, 30, 51440], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11772225952148438, "compression_ratio": 1.6459143968871595, "no_speech_prob": 0.006122464779764414}, {"id": 76, "seek": 20476, "start": 226.76, "end": 228.26, "text": " They were afraid of the people,", "tokens": [51465, 814, 645, 4638, 295, 264, 561, 11, 51540], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11772225952148438, "compression_ratio": 1.6459143968871595, "no_speech_prob": 0.006122464779764414}, {"id": 77, "seek": 20476, "start": 228.26, "end": 230.76, "text": " for they all held that John really was a prophet.", "tokens": [51540, 337, 436, 439, 5167, 300, 2619, 534, 390, 257, 18566, 13, 51665], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11772225952148438, "compression_ratio": 1.6459143968871595, "no_speech_prob": 0.006122464779764414}, {"id": 78, "seek": 20476, "start": 230.76, "end": 232.76, "text": " So they answered Jesus,", "tokens": [51665, 407, 436, 10103, 2705, 11, 51765], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11772225952148438, "compression_ratio": 1.6459143968871595, "no_speech_prob": 0.006122464779764414}, {"id": 79, "seek": 20476, "start": 232.76, "end": 234.26, "text": " We do not know.", "tokens": [51765, 492, 360, 406, 458, 13, 51840], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11772225952148438, "compression_ratio": 1.6459143968871595, "no_speech_prob": 0.006122464779764414}, {"id": 80, "seek": 23476, "start": 234.76, "end": 236.76, "text": " And Jesus said to them,", "tokens": [50365, 400, 2705, 848, 281, 552, 11, 50465], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11749348044395447, "compression_ratio": 1.024390243902439, "no_speech_prob": 0.0022593727335333824}, {"id": 81, "seek": 23476, "start": 236.76, "end": 240.76, "text": " Neither will I tell you by what authority I do these things.", "tokens": [50465, 23956, 486, 286, 980, 291, 538, 437, 8281, 286, 360, 613, 721, 13, 50665], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11749348044395447, "compression_ratio": 1.024390243902439, "no_speech_prob": 0.0022593727335333824}], "language": "English"}